## About Me

I'm a software engineer specializing in embedded systems and full-stack web development. Currently, I'm developing firmware on STM32 platforms and building modern web applications. My work focuses on:

- C/C++ firmware development
- Embedded Linux and RTOS-based systems
- Communication protocols (UART, SPI, I2C and CAN)
- Hardware-software integration
- Full-stack web development with React, Next.js and Node.js
- Performance optimization for resource-constrained systems

## Technologies

- Languages: C/C++, JavaScript and TypeScript
- Embedded Platforms: STM32, ARM Cortex-M and FreeRTOS
- Frameworks: React, Next.js and Express.js
- Databases: PostgreSQL and MySQL
- Operating Systems: Linux (Ubuntu) and Windows

